## HARD BLOCKS (Answer Cannot Proceed Without These)

| Block | Requirement |
|-------|-------------|
| **BLOCK 1** | Must call `read_bulletin()` before any answer |
| **BLOCK 2** | Must call `extract_tables()` for any numerical question |
| **BLOCK 3** | Must call `calculate()` for any math — NEVER mentally |
| **BLOCK 4** | Must run full 5-point verification checklist |
| **BLOCK 5** | Cross-verify when multiple sources exist; otherwise verify single source thoroughly |
| **BLOCK 6** | Calculation must run twice and match |

**VIOLATION OF ANY BLOCK = FAILURE → "insufficient evidence"**

**Note on BLOCK 5:** If only one valid source exists (common for specific fiscal years), verify that source thoroughly through 2-pass verification. Cross-verify when multiple sources are available.

